# DN-07 - request mau (IntelliJ HTTP Client hoac VS Code REST Client).
# Chay truoc: Postgres, mock (9000), identity (profile dev), profile-service, company-service (profile dev), gateway (8080).
# Xem docs/api/DN-07-job-review.md muc 6 "Cach chay". Moi request doi chieu voi muc 8 "Ca kiem thu".
# Du lieu mau (DevDataSeeder): Cong ty A ...a1 (hr1, hr-new), Cong ty B ...b2 (hr2).
# JD: ...0003-000000000002 "Fresher ReactJS" PENDING (A), ...004 DRAFT (A), ...003 APPROVED (A), ...008 APPROVED (B), ...009 PENDING (B).
# Chay tu tren xuong. Muc 6 khoa Cong ty A, muc 7 mo khoa lai. Dat lai JD mau: xem DN-07-job-review.md muc 6.
#
# Nen tang la UI-01: trang viec lam cong khai nam o GET /public/jobs, /public/jobs/{id}, /public/companies[/{id}];
# chi tiet JD cua HR van la GET /jobs/{id} (DN-02). Hang cho + duyet / tra lai la /staff/jobs** cua UI-01
# (quyen STAFF hoac ADMIN); DN-07 them POST /staff/jobs/{id}/close, ghi lich su company_actions va ma JOB_EXPIRED.
# Can bo khong thay JD nhap: danh sach / summary bo JD DRAFT va GET /staff/jobs/{id} tra 404.
# Nhung approve / reject / close tren mot JD DRAFT dang ton tai tra 409 INVALID_JOB_STATUS (tieu chi 5);
# 404 chi danh cho id khong co trong DB.

@gw = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@identity = http://localhost:8081
@internalKey = dev-internal-key
@A = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000a1
@B = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000b2
@hr1Id = 00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000001
@jdPendingA = 00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000002
@jdApprovedA = 00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000003
@jdDraftA = 00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000004
@jdApprovedB = 00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000008
@jdPendingB = 00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000009

############################## 1. Dang nhap ##############################

### 1a. Ve SSO cho staff1 (chi dev)
# @name staffTicket
POST {{gw}}/auth/dev/sso-ticket
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lmsUserId": "lms-st-001" }

### 1b. Doi ve lay token staff1
# @name staffSso
POST {{gw}}/auth/sso
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ticket": "{{staffTicket.response.body.ticket}}" }

### 1c. hr1 (Cong ty A)
# @name hr1Login
POST {{gw}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hr1@rikkeijobs.test", "password": "Test@123" }

############################## 2. Trang viec lam cong khai (UI-01) ##############################

### 2a. Khong token -> 200 {items, total, page, size}; chi JD APPROVED, con han, cong ty ACTIVE; moi tao truoc
# Seed: 4 JD (Thuc tap sinh Tester, 2 JD mau DN-06 cua A, Thuc tap sinh Marketing cua B). Khong co "Fresher ReactJS" (PENDING).
GET {{gw}}/public/jobs?page=1&size=100

### 2b. Token sai van 200 (khach xem duoc)
GET {{gw}}/public/jobs
Authorization: Bearer token-sai

### 2c. size = 101 -> 400 BAD_REQUEST; sort=abc cung 400
GET {{gw}}/public/jobs?size=101

### 2d. Chi tiet tin dang tuyen -> 200 PublicJobDetail (khong co status, rejectReason, reviewedBy, createdBy)
GET {{gw}}/public/jobs/{{jdApprovedA}}

### 2e. Chi tiet JD cho duyet -> 404 NOT_FOUND "Không tìm thấy tin tuyển dụng hoặc tin đã hết hạn."
# (giong JD nhap, bi tra lai, da dong, qua han, cong ty khoa, id khong ton tai)
GET {{gw}}/public/jobs/{{jdPendingA}}

### 2f. Bo loc va sap xep cua UI-01 -> 200; q khop tieu de / vi tri / ten cong ty
GET {{gw}}/public/jobs?q=java&sort=salary&page=1&size=20

### 2g. Danh sach cong ty cong khai -> 200 mang [{id, name, logoUrl, industry, size, city, openJobs}], nhieu tin truoc
GET {{gw}}/public/companies

### 2h. Ho so cong ty cong khai -> 200 PublicCompanyDetail; cong ty bi khoa hoac khong ton tai -> 404
GET {{gw}}/public/companies/{{A}}

############################## 3. Hang cho cua can bo ##############################

### 3a. Hang cho -> 200, 2 JD (A va B), gui som nhat truoc
GET {{gw}}/staff/jobs?status=PENDING&page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3b. Moi trang thai cua Cong ty A (tab "JD cua cong ty") -> 200, 6 JD (bo 1 JD nhap), moi cap nhat truoc
GET {{gw}}/staff/jobs?companyId={{A}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3c. status sai -> 400 BAD_REQUEST; status=DRAFT -> 400 "Cán bộ không xem được JD nháp."
GET {{gw}}/staff/jobs?status=PAUSED
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3c-2. So JD theo trang thai (so tren tab cua man Duyet JD) -> 200 {total, byStatus} du 4 khoa, khong co DRAFT
GET {{gw}}/staff/jobs/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3d. Chi tiet cho can bo -> 200 StaffJobDetail {job: {... status PENDING, rejectReason null}, reviewedBy null, company {status ACTIVE}}
GET {{gw}}/staff/jobs/{{jdPendingA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3d-2. Chi tiet JD nhap -> 404 NOT_FOUND "Không tìm thấy JD." (can bo khong thay ban nhap cua HR)
GET {{gw}}/staff/jobs/{{jdDraftA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3e. Token HR goi API can bo -> 403 FORBIDDEN (token ADMIN thi DUOC: /staff/jobs/** la STAFF_OR_ADMIN)
GET {{gw}}/staff/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3f. Token ADMIN: /staff/jobs/** DUOC (STAFF_OR_ADMIN) nhung /staff/companies/** -> 403 FORBIDDEN (chi STAFF).
# Lay token admin1 (SSO, lms-ad-001) nhu muc 1a/1b roi doi lmsUserId thanh "lms-ad-001", dung token do cho hai request duoi.
# @name adminTicket
POST {{gw}}/auth/dev/sso-ticket
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lmsUserId": "lms-ad-001" }

### 3f-2. Doi ve lay token admin1
# @name adminSso
POST {{gw}}/auth/sso
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ticket": "{{adminTicket.response.body.ticket}}" }

### 3f-3. ADMIN xem hang cho -> 200 (duoc phep)
GET {{gw}}/staff/jobs?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{adminSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3f-4. ADMIN xem chi tiet cong ty -> 403 FORBIDDEN (/staff/companies/** chi STAFF)
GET {{gw}}/staff/companies/{{A}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminSso.response.body.accessToken}}

############################## 4. Tra lai, HR sua, duyet ##############################

### 4a. Tra lai khong co ly do -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR, errors.reason = "Vui lòng nhập lý do"
POST {{gw}}/staff/jobs/{{jdPendingA}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "   " }

### 4b. Tra lai co ly do -> 200 REJECTED, rejectReason, reviewedBy {id, fullName "Hoàng Thu Hà"}
POST {{gw}}/staff/jobs/{{jdPendingA}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Mô tả công việc còn sơ sài, bổ sung phần quyền lợi và mức lương cụ thể." }

### 4c. HR thay ly do tra lai (chi tiet JD cua HR la GET /jobs/{id}, DN-02) -> 200 REJECTED, rejectReason
GET {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdPendingA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4d. HR gui duyet lai (giao dien: sua roi Gui duyet) -> 200 PENDING, rejectReason null
POST {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdPendingA}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4e. Duyet JD nhap -> 409 INVALID_JOB_STATUS "JD vẫn là bản nháp, HR chưa gửi duyệt nên cán bộ không xử lý được.", khong ghi lich su
POST {{gw}}/staff/jobs/{{jdDraftA}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4e-2. Tra lai JD nhap -> 409 INVALID_JOB_STATUS (cung thong bao), khong ghi lich su
POST {{gw}}/staff/jobs/{{jdDraftA}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Thu tra lai ban nhap" }

### 4e-3. Dong JD nhap -> 409 INVALID_JOB_STATUS (cung thong bao), khong ghi lich su
POST {{gw}}/staff/jobs/{{jdDraftA}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Thu dong ban nhap" }

### 4e-4. Duyet mot id khong ton tai -> 404 NOT_FOUND "Không tìm thấy JD."
POST {{gw}}/staff/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000ff/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4f. Duyet JD cho duyet -> 200 APPROVED, rejectReason null, reviewedAt moi
POST {{gw}}/staff/jobs/{{jdPendingA}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4g. Duyet lan hai -> 409 INVALID_JOB_STATUS
POST {{gw}}/staff/jobs/{{jdPendingA}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4h. Trang viec lam nay co "Fresher ReactJS" -> 200, total 5
GET {{gw}}/public/jobs?size=100

############################## 5. Dong JD dang tuyen ##############################

### 5a. Dong JD cho duyet -> 409 INVALID_JOB_STATUS
POST {{gw}}/staff/jobs/{{jdPendingB}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Thu dong JD chua duyet" }

### 5b. Dong JD dang tuyen co ly do -> 200 CLOSED; JD bien khoi GET /public/jobs.
# Luu y: dong JD ghi de reviewedBy/reviewedAt bang nguoi dong; nguoi duyet truoc do chi con trong lich su (muc 6i).
POST {{gw}}/staff/jobs/{{jdApprovedA}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Tin trùng với đợt tuyển thực tập đã kết thúc." }

############################## 6. Khoa Cong ty A ##############################

### 6a. Khoa khong ly do -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR, errors.reason; cong ty khong doi
POST {{gw}}/staff/companies/{{A}}/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "" }

### 6b. Khoa co ly do -> 200 StaffCompanyDetail, status LOCKED, lock {lockedAt, reason, lockedBy}, moi hrAccounts companyLocked = true
POST {{gw}}/staff/companies/{{A}}/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Đăng tin tuyển dụng sai sự thật nhiều lần, chờ xác minh lại giấy phép." }

### 6c. Khoa lan hai -> 409 CONFLICT "Công ty đã bị khoá"
POST {{gw}}/staff/companies/{{A}}/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Khoa lai" }

### 6d. Trang viec lam chi con JD cua Cong ty B
GET {{gw}}/public/jobs?size=100

### 6e. JD da duyet cua A -> 404; ho so cong khai cua A cung 404 va A bien khoi GET /public/companies
GET {{gw}}/public/jobs/{{jdPendingA}}

### 6f. Token cu cua hr1 -> 401 ACCOUNT_DISABLED "Công ty của bạn đang bị khoá, liên hệ cán bộ tuyển dụng" (company-service)
GET {{gw}}/companies/me/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6f-2. Token cu cua hr1 tren duong CONG KHAI cung 401 (HrLockedFilter chay truoc controller) - chap nhan co chu dich
GET {{gw}}/public/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6g. Token cu cua hr1 o identity -> 401 ACCOUNT_DISABLED
GET {{gw}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6h. hr1 dang nhap dung mat khau -> 403 ACCOUNT_DISABLED "Công ty của bạn đang bị khoá, liên hệ cán bộ tuyển dụng"
# (sai mat khau van 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS, khong lo email nao dang bi khoa)
POST {{gw}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hr1@rikkeijobs.test", "password": "Test@123" }

### 6i. Lich su -> 200, moi nhat truoc: LOCK, CLOSE_JD, APPROVE_JD, REJECT_JD; staff.fullName, job.title, reason
GET {{gw}}/staff/companies/{{A}}/history?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6j. (noi bo, KHONG qua gateway) lookup -> status LOCKED, companyLocked true
POST {{identity}}/internal/users/lookup
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userIds": ["{{hr1Id}}"] }

### 6k. (noi bo) application-context cua JD cua A -> companyLocked true
GET http://localhost:8085/internal/jobs/{{jdPendingA}}/application-context
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

############################## 7. Mo khoa ##############################

### 7a. Mo khoa -> 200, status ACTIVE, lock null, hrAccounts companyLocked = false
POST {{gw}}/staff/companies/{{A}}/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7b. Mo khoa lan hai -> 409 CONFLICT "Công ty không bị khoá"
POST {{gw}}/staff/companies/{{A}}/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{staffSso.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7c. JD cua A hien lai
GET {{gw}}/public/jobs?size=100

### 7d. hr1 dang nhap lai duoc -> 200
POST {{gw}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hr1@rikkeijobs.test", "password": "Test@123" }

############################## 8. API noi bo company-lock cua identity (KHONG qua gateway) ##############################

### 8a. Thieu khoa -> 401 INVALID_SERVICE_KEY
POST {{identity}}/internal/users/company-lock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userIds": ["{{hr1Id}}"], "locked": true }

### 8b. Danh sach rong -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{identity}}/internal/users/company-lock
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userIds": [], "locked": true }
